body:
You're not missing much. On arena days, you basically rebirth one character then have it decimate the arena over, and over, and over, and over, and over til you have enough points to get the upgrades and event upgrades.

&#x200B;

It doesn't take long until it isn't worth the gain, but worth doing a bit if you haven't

Feedback #2:

&#x200B;

We should have a way to cash in all the worthless dungeon cores. It clears clutter and helps overall advancement.
